    "text": {
      "en": "Look at the tail. A Rough-legged has a white tail with a broad dark band at the tip, while a Common Buzzard's tail is brown with fine bars. Under the wing, the Rough-legged has big black carpal patches and a dark belly. A Rough-legged Buzzard also hovers on long wings."
